1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:02,810
(Sheldon:)I know how to
get the bucket!

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:04,780
(Sheldon:)I can turn the axe around

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,300
(Sheldon:)and use the handle to reach it.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,280
(Sheldon:)Let's see.

5
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:11,720
(Sheldon:)Go north.

6
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,300
"You are in a forest."

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,020
(Sheldon:)Go north.

8
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,450
"You are in a forest."

9
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,890
(Sheldon:)Go north.

10
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,560
"You are in a forest."
Oh dear, I believe I'm lost.

11
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,630
(Sheldon:)Well, I'll just have to get
a fresh start tomorrow.

12
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:24,510
No, no, no! You just
took a wrong turn.

13
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:26,000
(Leonard:)You just need to map it out.

14
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
(Leonard:)Come on, I'll help you.

15
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,470
So you stopped at the stream,

16
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:30,180
(Leonard:)and you turned
north three times?

17
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:31,340
(Howard:)Yes.

18
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,940
(Leonard:)You're right.
You're lost. Good luck.

19
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:40,530
(Priya:)Oh!

20
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:41,580
(Priya:)Leonard. Wake up.

21
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,580
Huh? Wh-- Sorry.

22
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,120
(Priya:)For what?

23
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:46,550
(Leonard:)I don't know. When I'm in bed
with a girl, it's just--

24
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,450
it's my go-to response.

25
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:50,460
It's 6:00. I have
to get back to Raj's

26
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,290
(Priya:)before he wakes up
and realizes I'm gone.

27
00:00:52,290 --> 00:00:54,640
(Leonard:)Oh. Right. Sure.

28
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:57,180
(Leonard:)I wish you could stay
in L.A. a while longer.

